          "date": "2026-11-16T23:58:36Z"
        },
        "message": "Restore main content deleted by sparse branch merges\n\nBetween 2026-11-16 23:19Z and 23:46Z, auto-merge landed a run of PRs whose\nbranch tips had been replaced by sparse tree snapshots. Each such merge\nremoved every path the branch did not materialize, taking main from 434,565\nfiles at c0b657b6d5 down to roughly 13k files.\n\nThis commit restores, onto the current main tree, every path that existed at\nc0b657b6d5 and is now missing (425,141 files, including the submodule\ngitlink). Paths added or modified after c0b657b6d5 are left untouched, so PR\npayloads merged in that window are preserved.\n\nRestores .github/scripts/ci-scope.mjs, tools/artifacts/, the research\narchives, the website snapshots and the workflow set that main's own CI and\ntooling require.\n\nOne path is deliberately not restored here:\n.github/workflows/pcc-gate.yml. Main already carries 147 claim records without\nthe mandatory claim_type (a pre-existing, documented PCC blocker), so\nreinstating that workflow would immediately fail the required `gate` check.\nIt should come back in a focused follow-up once those claim records are\nmigrated.",
