        },
        "message": "ic: add binary-field HECDLP index calculus and hecx front door\n\n- characteristic-two Jacobian IC: Artin-Schreier point construction, trace Cantor-Zassenhaus smoothness, factor-base walk, sparse linear algebra and threaded relation collection\n- generic BSGS / Pohlig-Hellman / CRT over prime and binary hyperelliptic groups\n- hecx CLI: list, inspect, estimate, run and demo for arbitrary genus, coefficients and subgroup orders\n- fast validated-once Jacobian arithmetic paths, sampled reduced prime bases, wide-prime support and large-field Hasse intervals\n- docs/ic/HECX.md and engine tests",
